+Implement JWT authentication.
+
+Files:
+- settings.py
+- serializers.py
+- views.py
+- urls.py
+
+Tasks:
+1. Update settings.py:
+   - Add rest_framework, corsheaders, authentication, rest_framework_simplejwt.
+   - Configure REST_FRAMEWORK with JWT authentication.
+   - Configure CORS.
+   - Add SIMPLE_JWT settings.
+
+2. Create RegisterSerializer in serializers.py.
+
+3. Create RegisterView and UserProfileView (IsAuthenticated) in views.py.
+
+4. Update urls.py with:
+   - POST /auth/register/
+   - POST /auth/login/
+   - POST /auth/refresh/
+   - GET /auth/me/
+
+5. Verify imports and integration.
+
+6. Run:
+   /run python manage.py migrate
+
+Show diffs before applying changes.

